#!/usr/bin/env python3
"""Exact/oracle ceilings on the EXACTGEN2 prefix frozen on 2026-09-10.

The source tree and virtual environment are read-only inputs.  This runner uses
one Python process, one thread per numerical runtime, and writes only its local
resumable receipt.
"""

